<div class="page-header">
  <h2>Bid Writing Guides</h2>
  <a href="/guides/new" class="btn btn-primary">+ New Guide</a>
</div>
<p class="page-desc">Proposal writing templates, checklists, and guidance for crafting competitive, compliant bids — organized by opportunity type.</p>

<details class="how-to">
  <summary>How to use Bid Writing Guides</summary>
  <div class="how-to-body">
    <ol>
      <li>Create a guide for each <strong>type of opportunity</strong> you pursue — Government Contract, Grant, Subcontract. Each guide becomes your personal playbook for that opportunity type.</li>
      <li>Mark a guide as a <strong>Template</strong> if it contains reusable boilerplate (company overview, capability statements, past performance paragraphs) that you copy into proposals.</li>
      <li>Include section-by-section instructions, compliance checklists, common evaluation criteria, and notes on what evaluators look for in your sector.</li>
      <li>Reference your guides when working an active pursuit in the Pipeline — open the relevant guide alongside the solicitation to stay compliant and competitive.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Start with a Government Contract guide and a Grant guide. Add your standard capability statement text so it's always one click away when writing proposals.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<% if (guides.length === 0) { %>
  <p class="empty-state">No guides yet. <a href="/guides/new">Create your first bid writing guide</a>.</p>
<% } else { %>
  <div class="guide-grid">
    <% guides.forEach(function(g) { %>
      <div class="guide-card">
        <div class="guide-card-header">
          <span class="badge"><%= g.opportunity_type %></span>
          <% if (g.is_template) { %><span class="badge badge--template">Template</span><% } %>
        </div>
        <h3 class="guide-title"><a href="/guides/<%= g.id %>"><%= g.title %></a></h3>
        <div class="guide-actions">
          <a href="/guides/<%= g.id %>/edit" class="btn-link">Edit</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% }); %>
  </div>
<% } %>
